erence [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]aggregation summary, an `unused_only` artifact-file query filter applied[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]before the row limit, and a fragment-free reference renderer, all [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]exposed through `sase_core_rs`.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Python ledger module and the expansion call site[/bold #D7AFFF]              [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]py-ledger[dim] · [dim][/dim]after core-ledger[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]py-ledger: raise the core pin, add the event record with its role [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]vocabulary and locked append, and record one edge per successfully [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]expanded reference at the launch rewrite path without ever being able to[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]fail a launch.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Consumption on `sase artifact show` and `--unused` on `sase [/bold #D7AFFF]  [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]artifact list`[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]read-surfaces[dim] · [dim][/dim]after py-ledger[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]read-surfaces: add the Rust-backed summary facade, report consumption [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]counts and consuming agents for any reference, and add the alphabetized [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]`-u/--unused` list filter that reaches the query rather than [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]post-filtering it.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Docs, skill, and ledger reference[/bold #D7AFFF]                             [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]docs-and-ledger-reference[dim] · [dim][/dim]after read-surfaces[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]docs-and-ledger-reference: document the ledger file, its record shape, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the role vocabulary, and the new read surfaces in the artifact [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]documentation and the `sase_artifact_file` skill source, and regenerate [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the deployed skill.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-b9","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-5.6-sol","phase_bead_id":"sase-b9.1","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-91631d658ac02cf3294f541f33b8214d","started_at":"2026-07-30T14:37:32.994760+00:00","state":"completed"},{"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"2045b2b4cb13c55d7efa72932f2c54580aaa44f25e6f99458c9f06cc9babe486","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-b9.4/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"meta":{"digest":"8a11d0c7ea065871fee1dafaf25688dd6be79003d992bd8bc72bee6d572b5ee8","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-b9.4/meta.json","size_bytes":600},"prompt":{"digest":"3950507ea7bd339d292ded5f30736e3bad3ddc21fc2f5fc5b48a06a74aea6bf3","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-b9.4/prompt.md","size_bytes":153},"state":{"digest":"05b653d93acfbd5dc928b94ed934ca322906db062da20123f3baf50e927fbb27","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-b9.4/state.json","size_bytes":163}},"finished_at":null,"global_name":"bbugyi200.athena.sase-b9.4","local_name":"sase-b9.4","metadata":{"agent_clan":"sase-b9","agent_clan_generation":"20260730103719","approve":true,"bead_id":"sase-b9.4","changespec_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","cl_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-b9","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-5.5","phase_bead_id":"sase-b9.4","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-a7bdf924ebe079e2b05277ccc9f6c6cb","started_at":"20260730103722","state":"waiting"},{"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"51917eae5108442a931df8baf3b88ae6113323f94647c91cec586cc1577f3c95","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-b9.land/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"meta":{"digest":"8486f8789f5d60152a10da5aeb5b7529bebdd67fadad474d5a87a6285d5ec67